(7471299, 1186934, 128323, '<td valign="top">Wow.  This is disturbing.  Not only with a gun pointed at a child, but with another child''s hands on the trigger.  I applaud your photo, but I could never set up a photo shoot and ask one kid to point a gun at another kid.  I imagine you''ll get one hell of a response on this one.  <br/> <br/>10 from me for pushing the boundaries and doing it with very competent photography and processing.</td>', 'Wow.  This is disturbing.  Not only with a gun pointed at a child, but with another child''s hands on the trigger.  I applaud your photo, but I could never set up a photo shoot and ask one kid to point a gun at another kid.  I imagine you''ll get one hell of a response on this one.   10 from me for pushing the boundaries and doing it with very competent photography and processing.', '2016-09-02 17:58:29.000000', NULL, 1),
