(7471435, 1186697, 50695, '<td valign="top">The locust is created from adolescence by desire.<br/>Anything else is merely a grasshopper.<br/>The locust isn''t like a mouse, indifferent to the disease it carries.<br/>Without a plague, there is no locust,<br/>flying over anxious miles,<br/>rolling over vibrant fields,<br/>spattered brightly on rotting barns</td>', 'The locust is created from adolescence by desire.Anything else is merely a grasshopper.The locust isn''t like a mouse, indifferent to the disease it carries.Without a plague, there is no locust,flying over anxious miles,rolling over vibrant fields,spattered brightly on rotting barns', '2016-09-03 16:37:13.000000', NULL, 1),
