(7471575, 1186746, 50695, '<td valign="top">If I were me I would do my job,<br/>I would sleep in my bed,<br/>I would love my family,<br/>I would pet my dog,<br/>I would vote my conscience<br/>and believe my beliefs.<br/> <br/>If I were the sky I would be blue above me,<br/>offering clouds, massaging solar panels,<br/>drape flatly over heaven, pin down<br/>my horizon.<br/> <br/>If I were not I would anything,<br/>empires would fall, a disaster of paradises<br/>would clutter my empty will.</td>', 'If I were me I would do my job,I would sleep in my bed,I would love my family,I would pet my dog,I would vote my conscienceand believe my beliefs. If I were the sky I would be blue above me,offering clouds, massaging solar panels,drape flatly over heaven, pin downmy horizon. If I were not I would anything,empires would fall, a disaster of paradiseswould clutter my empty will.', '2016-09-03 21:22:32.000000', NULL, 1),
