(7471601, 1186960, 50695, '<td valign="top">They were told not to walk in their bare feet.<br/>They were warned of microorganisms.<br/>They heard the whisper of sharp things.<br/> <br/>But then the sun colluded with the grass,<br/>shoes peeled away,<br/>and summer asked them to the dance.</td>', 'They were told not to walk in their bare feet.They were warned of microorganisms.They heard the whisper of sharp things. But then the sun colluded with the grass,shoes peeled away,and summer asked them to the dance.', '2016-09-03 22:43:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7471604, 1186791, 50695, '<td valign="top">It''s not everything you hoped for.<br/>The service isn''t great, <br/>they don''t think you need anything.<br/>The prices are absurd.<br/>You laugh at them.<br/>You sound like a Hummel gazelle<br/>rolling down the stairs.</td>', 'It''s not everything you hoped for.The service isn''t great, they don''t think you need anything.The prices are absurd.You laugh at them.You sound like a Hummel gazellerolling down the stairs.', '2016-09-03 22:55:14.000000', NULL, 1),
