(7471638, 1186746, 98565, '<td valign="top">If I were a solar panel<br/>I''d love it when the sky was blue<br/>but above all other things<br/>I''d collect sunrays for you</td>', 'If I were a solar panelI''d love it when the sky was bluebut above all other thingsI''d collect sunrays for you', '2016-09-04 04:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7471647, 1186126, 50695, '<td valign="top">I feel the stories blend together<br/>like buildings at dusk, <br/>and then when I''m about to lose them<br/>they light up.<br/> <br/>Entering the city at night<br/>you see only ideas<br/>outlining the concrete.<br/>You buy a ticket. That''s how you pray.</td>', 'I feel the stories blend togetherlike buildings at dusk, and then when I''m about to lose themthey light up. Entering the city at nightyou see only ideasoutlining the concrete.You buy a ticket. That''s how you pray.', '2016-09-04 11:29:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7471686, 1186261, 183150, '<td valign="top">There is a hidden place<br/>That your parents forgot<br/>Where the world grew<br/>Upside<br/>Down<br/>The hills swam deep in the skies<br/>And the mountains grew unnoticed</td>', 'There is a hidden placeThat your parents forgotWhere the world grewUpsideDownThe hills swam deep in the skiesAnd the mountains grew unnoticed', '2016-09-04 14:07:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7471696, 1186134, 50695, '<td valign="top">is like goin'' to an art show:<br/>a whirlpool of broken glass beneath a fallen willow,<br/>the strokes of squirrel tails,<br/>leaves upturned like armada sails,<br/>the artfully blank canvas of a field of corn<br/>with subtle variations of tone.<br/>It makes you want to stop the horse, step down<br/>and meet the artist, but he left town.</td>', 'is like goin'' to an art show:a whirlpool of broken glass beneath a fallen willow,the strokes of squirrel tails,leaves upturned like armada sails,the artfully blank canvas of a field of cornwith subtle variations of tone.It makes you want to stop the horse, step downand meet the artist, but he left town.', '2016-09-04 14:37:27.000000', NULL, 1),
