(7472373, 1186324, 50695, '<td valign="top">I love you deeper than coal, and darker.<br/>I carve us into trees.<br/>I ribbon around you like a mountain road.<br/>I''m in your eyes like headlights at night.<br/>You flash them at me, <br/>lean into your horn,<br/>and disappear.</td>', 'I love you deeper than coal, and darker.I carve us into trees.I ribbon around you like a mountain road.I''m in your eyes like headlights at night.You flash them at me, lean into your horn,and disappear.', '2016-09-05 19:46:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7472374, 1186969, 50695, '<td valign="top">Nobody knows why. Is it the rind?<br/>Do they remember the yellow?<br/>Does the sourness purse them back<br/>towards life?<br/> <br/>Of course, every ghost is a story,<br/>unique, though not told,<br/>but all are over, and maybe crave<br/>a palate cleanser.</td>', 'Nobody knows why. Is it the rind?Do they remember the yellow?Does the sourness purse them backtowards life? Of course, every ghost is a story,unique, though not told,but all are over, and maybe cravea palate cleanser.', '2016-09-05 19:51:57.000000', NULL, 1),
