(7472437, 1186873, 50695, '<td valign="top">Leaves made of silver filament<br/>glimmering down from a pewter tree, <br/>John Lennon''s eyeglasses,<br/>purchased but never worn,<br/>banana bicycles, painted grapes,<br/>the Rolodex of Zsa Zsa Gabor<br/>with names angrily scratched out,<br/>blades of toy helicopters,<br/>tiny gods with broken legs,<br/>suicide notebooks, gilded ziti,<br/>and one item so precious<br/>you''ll never find it<br/>among the dust and noise, even though<br/>you came in with it.</td>', 'Leaves made of silver filamentglimmering down from a pewter tree, John Lennon''s eyeglasses,purchased but never worn,banana bicycles, painted grapes,the Rolodex of Zsa Zsa Gaborwith names angrily scratched out,blades of toy helicopters,tiny gods with broken legs,suicide notebooks, gilded ziti,and one item so preciousyou''ll never find itamong the dust and noise, even thoughyou came in with it.', '2016-09-05 21:04:28.000000', NULL, 1),
