(7472640, 1186964, 50695, '<td valign="top">A heron eats, a salmon dies, there is no conflict here.<br/>A nation goes to war, its people puff with pride,<br/>then try some rituals of grief, then tire of killing,<br/>the same as the other side. No conflict, only truth,<br/>only the violence of pianos being played, perfectly tuned.</td>', 'A heron eats, a salmon dies, there is no conflict here.A nation goes to war, its people puff with pride,then try some rituals of grief, then tire of killing,the same as the other side. No conflict, only truth,only the violence of pianos being played, perfectly tuned.', '2016-09-06 00:53:06.000000', NULL, 1),
