(7472691, 1186164, 50641, '<td valign="top">Such a devilish quand''ry   I''ve got,<br/>On the horns of a ticklish elision.<br/>Here, writing verse in the parking lot,<br/>Praying there''ll   be no collision.<br/> <br/>Here, writing verse when the pavement''s  hot, <br/>Hoping to avoid the confusion  <br/>Caused by composing the perfect shot,<br/>since offered to this collusion.<br/> <br/>Thus, such a devilish quand''ry  I''ve  got,<br/>This pursuit of null derision.<br/>We''ve   combined for an intersecting plot<br/>While avoiding a sound decision.<br/> <br/>,</td>', 'Such a devilish quand''ry   I''ve got,On the horns of a ticklish elision.Here, writing verse in the parking lot,Praying there''ll   be no collision. Here, writing verse when the pavement''s  hot, Hoping to avoid the confusion  Caused by composing the perfect shot,since offered to this collusion. Thus, such a devilish quand''ry  I''ve  got,This pursuit of null derision.We''ve   combined for an intersecting plotWhile avoiding a sound decision. ,', '2016-09-06 05:42:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7472696, 1186965, 50641, '<td valign="top">Two years my little field  <br/>Since  I  fled  and  left  you  fallow  <br/> <br/>Your gamish of gilded grassheads  <br/>Gaily sways<br/> <br/>I''ll  return in springtime<br/>To shoo the snakes and woodchucks<br/> <br/>Impose my patterns upon your  patterns  <br/>Pair furrows  with  purpose<br/>And pray <br/> <br/>That the churlish   crow may spare some seed to grow.</td>', 'Two years my little field  Since  I  fled  and  left  you  fallow   Your gamish of gilded grassheads  Gaily sways I''ll  return in springtimeTo shoo the snakes and woodchucks Impose my patterns upon your  patterns  Pair furrows  with  purposeAnd pray  That the churlish   crow may spare some seed to grow.', '2016-09-06 06:19:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7472806, 1186925, 63398, '<td valign="top">The mother swan despairs.....her youngest gone.<br/> <br/>She tried to save her.....the fox was too quick....<br/> <br/>She flailed, shreiked, attacked as best she could...<br/> <br/>But in the end all that was left was......tears and feathers.</td>', 'The mother swan despairs.....her youngest gone. She tried to save her.....the fox was too quick.... She flailed, shreiked, attacked as best she could... But in the end all that was left was......tears and feathers.', '2016-09-06 18:02:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7472809, 1186938, 63398, '<td valign="top">Though the sun rose over the swampland.....<br/> <br/>The mists shrouded the distance.<br/> <br/>Gators cough, loons sound their mournful warble...<br/> <br/>The traveler is left.....Crossing the unknown</td>', 'Though the sun rose over the swampland..... The mists shrouded the distance. Gators cough, loons sound their mournful warble... The traveler is left.....Crossing the unknown', '2016-09-06 18:05:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7472810, 1186966, 63398, '<td valign="top">Spun her web beside her....<br/> <br/>She caught wasps and flies.....<br/> <br/>That flew in with the sunrise...<br/> <br/>And Miss Muffett was protected for the day.</td>', 'Spun her web beside her.... She caught wasps and flies..... That flew in with the sunrise... And Miss Muffett was protected for the day.', '2016-09-06 18:09:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7472811, 1186955, 63398, '<td valign="top">Rolling with the current on lazy days.<br/> <br/>The brothers swam and then they fished.<br/> <br/>Took all of the time they wished.<br/> <br/>Hoping never to have to grow old.<br/> <br/>That the weather would never turn cold.</td>', 'Rolling with the current on lazy days. The brothers swam and then they fished. Took all of the time they wished. Hoping never to have to grow old. That the weather would never turn cold.', '2016-09-06 18:12:36.000000', NULL, 1),
