(7472857, 1186927, 50695, '<td valign="top">I tried to explain my garden to my cardiologist.<br/>I wanted to walk him through the affinity of species<br/>on hand-placed stones. I cried about caterpillars.<br/>The seasons meant more to me than a mortality clock.<br/>Entire existences pulsed out and back. I guided life,<br/>mostly watching and weeding, occasional touches.<br/>I wanted him to know what my heart was doing.</td>', 'I tried to explain my garden to my cardiologist.I wanted to walk him through the affinity of specieson hand-placed stones. I cried about caterpillars.The seasons meant more to me than a mortality clock.Entire existences pulsed out and back. I guided life,mostly watching and weeding, occasional touches.I wanted him to know what my heart was doing.', '2016-09-06 21:19:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7472859, 1186119, 50695, '<td valign="top">You''re strapped into a narrow vehicle of flesh.<br/>Any divergence from a predefined course is met with terrible consequences.<br/>When you figure out how to enjoy it, it''s over.</td>', 'You''re strapped into a narrow vehicle of flesh.Any divergence from a predefined course is met with terrible consequences.When you figure out how to enjoy it, it''s over.', '2016-09-06 21:20:35.000000', NULL, 1),
