(7473253, 1186852, 50695, '<td valign="top">That tiny bloom has the same determination as cancer.<br/>You can pick a flower, but can you stop all flowering?<br/>What pill can we prescribe to Earth?</td>', 'That tiny bloom has the same determination as cancer.You can pick a flower, but can you stop all flowering?What pill can we prescribe to Earth?', '2016-09-08 13:44:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473255, 1186261, 50695, '<td valign="top">We offend them, like yellowjackets at a funeral.<br/>They shrug unnoticed. We color them at the base<br/>and lose will towards the top. They ignore us unnoticed.<br/>They sigh and explain things to each other unnoticed.<br/>They won''t die within our noticing. They refuse unnoticed.</td>', 'We offend them, like yellowjackets at a funeral.They shrug unnoticed. We color them at the baseand lose will towards the top. They ignore us unnoticed.They sigh and explain things to each other unnoticed.They won''t die within our noticing. They refuse unnoticed.', '2016-09-08 14:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
