(7473257, 1186945, 50695, '<td valign="top">I was flying predestined, without free will,<br/>subject to wind and preordained adjustments<br/>which were programmed by evolution into the deep structure of my brain<br/>to respond to an environment I had no control over.<br/>Felt good.</td>', 'I was flying predestined, without free will,subject to wind and preordained adjustmentswhich were programmed by evolution into the deep structure of my brainto respond to an environment I had no control over.Felt good.', '2016-09-08 14:53:48.000000', NULL, 1),
