(7473264, 1186122, 50695, '<td valign="top">Every stupid idea comes from the wilderness,<br/>staring hugely at us through a window,<br/>the wrong color but the color is from the wilderness.<br/>Styrofoam stares beastly through bean-strangled coffee.<br/>Jungles are clapping for misinformed compromise.<br/>Every molecule in the Universe is a hyena.<br/>Back to the wilderness, Grandma. <br/>Let the mountain stream drink you.</td>', 'Every stupid idea comes from the wilderness,staring hugely at us through a window,the wrong color but the color is from the wilderness.Styrofoam stares beastly through bean-strangled coffee.Jungles are clapping for misinformed compromise.Every molecule in the Universe is a hyena.Back to the wilderness, Grandma. Let the mountain stream drink you.', '2016-09-08 16:18:23.000000', NULL, 1),
