(7473290, 1186899, 50695, '<td valign="top">When you remember something, you see it again,<br/>and that vision replaces the original memory.<br/>You draw a picture of a rocking horse<br/>with the legs too long, the sickle feet<br/>curving from nose to tail,<br/>and you glue it into your old family album.<br/>The glue invades the photographs <br/>like the sunlight in your backyard<br/>when you were a child, stampeding<br/>on the lawn with merciless prints,<br/>overexposed and quickly losing focus.<br/> <br/> <br/>I''m hanging this in my fantasy gallery<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1077279" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg"/></a></td>', 'When you remember something, you see it again,and that vision replaces the original memory.You draw a picture of a rocking horsewith the legs too long, the sickle feetcurving from nose to tail,and you glue it into your old family album.The glue invades the photographs like the sunlight in your backyardwhen you were a child, stampedingon the lawn with merciless prints,overexposed and quickly losing focus.  I''m hanging this in my fantasy gallery ', '2016-09-08 17:07:36.000000', NULL, 1),
