(7473296, 1186940, 50695, '<td valign="top">It starts with a Kingsize bed. Then she takes a job in the next town.<br/>After a while, her shoes turn into sneakers. You can''t smell her hair.<br/>You only see her for five minutes a day when you talk about dinner.<br/>Then you only see her through windows. She is rooting for a rival sports team.<br/>She has entire bank accounts you know nothing about. And vacations.<br/>She is the poet laureate of a completely different state. She eats haluski.<br/>After a few years, you''re hearing about her children. Autism, not autism.<br/>Her voice becomes more wonderful and strange than polar bears.<br/>She''s just a picture in a book you never opened because you''re saving it for a gift<br/>for someone you haven''t met yet, who will need just the right thing.<br/> <br/>I''m hanging this in my fantasy gallery<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1077279" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg"/></a></td>', 'It starts with a Kingsize bed. Then she takes a job in the next town.After a while, her shoes turn into sneakers. You can''t smell her hair.You only see her for five minutes a day when you talk about dinner.Then you only see her through windows. She is rooting for a rival sports team.She has entire bank accounts you know nothing about. And vacations.She is the poet laureate of a completely different state. She eats haluski.After a few years, you''re hearing about her children. Autism, not autism.Her voice becomes more wonderful and strange than polar bears.She''s just a picture in a book you never opened because you''re saving it for a giftfor someone you haven''t met yet, who will need just the right thing. I''m hanging this in my fantasy gallery ', '2016-09-08 17:09:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473297, 1186935, 50695, '<td valign="top">One more day and I''ll have this figured out.<br/>One more day of grass <br/>bruising the sky with shadows,<br/>one more day of gentle memories lost,<br/>one more day of wasps building homes underground.<br/>Sunlight is a slow paintbrush, too fine, too often abandoning<br/>the labyrinths of unremarked detours, always wanting one more day<br/>with its shifting indifferent canvas.</td>', 'One more day and I''ll have this figured out.One more day of grass bruising the sky with shadows,one more day of gentle memories lost,one more day of wasps building homes underground.Sunlight is a slow paintbrush, too fine, too often abandoningthe labyrinths of unremarked detours, always wanting one more daywith its shifting indifferent canvas.', '2016-09-08 17:09:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473298, 1186933, 50695, '<td valign="top">A man smiling to himself is the meteor of misunderstood waiting room conversations.<br/>A woman whistling is the bullfighter of a disappointing moon.<br/>A boy throwing a ball against a wall is the burning history of losers.<br/>A girl braiding her hair is the yearlong relevance of the Pony Express.<br/>Last night, the southwest coast of Italy was devastated by a frown turned upside-down.<br/>We waited three days for the death of a Florentine pedagogue to arrive. It smelled Protestant.<br/>I''ll let you know as soon as peregrinations find their summer abyss.<br/>You''ll be the first to be first. People will wish on you.</td>', 'A man smiling to himself is the meteor of misunderstood waiting room conversations.A woman whistling is the bullfighter of a disappointing moon.A boy throwing a ball against a wall is the burning history of losers.A girl braiding her hair is the yearlong relevance of the Pony Express.Last night, the southwest coast of Italy was devastated by a frown turned upside-down.We waited three days for the death of a Florentine pedagogue to arrive. It smelled Protestant.I''ll let you know as soon as peregrinations find their summer abyss.You''ll be the first to be first. People will wish on you.', '2016-09-08 17:09:49.000000', NULL, 1),
