(7473377, 1186968, 50641, '<td valign="top">I crawled to the monkey bars<br/>And found myself in a rut<br/>There were neither beers nor cocktails<br/>But the monkeys flew out of my butt.<br/> <br/>I swam to the milky way<br/>And found a pig in a poke<br/>We  spend the night makin  bacon<br/>And snicker whenever we smoke.<br/> <br/>I flew to the Dali Museum<br/>But now can''t  remember the trip<br/>Yet I got me a handlebar mustache<br/>And a clock that goes tick tock drip.</td>', 'I crawled to the monkey barsAnd found myself in a rutThere were neither beers nor cocktailsBut the monkeys flew out of my butt. I swam to the milky wayAnd found a pig in a pokeWe  spend the night makin  baconAnd snicker whenever we smoke. I flew to the Dali MuseumBut now can''t  remember the tripYet I got me a handlebar mustacheAnd a clock that goes tick tock drip.', '2016-09-09 00:04:41.000000', NULL, 1),
