(7473423, 1186679, 182146, '<td valign="top">Hi and thanks a lot for all your kind comments and the high final note, i''m really flattered ! <br/>Thanks also to all the poets here, i''m happy to have inspired you. <br/>Til this is not my mother''s tongue, i''m giving you the english poem i found initialy :<br/> <br/><i>The low lands call<br/>I am tempted to answer<br/>They are offering me a free dwelling <br/>Without having to conquer<br/> <br/>The massive mountain makes its move<br/>Beckoning me to ascend<br/>A much more difficult path<br/>To get up the slippery bend<br/> <br/>I cannot choose both <br/>I have a choice to make<br/>I must be wise<br/>This will determine my fate<br/> <br/>I choose, I choose the mountain<br/>With all its stress and strain<br/>Because only by climbing<br/>Can I rise above the plain<br/> <br/>I choose the mountain <br/>And I will never stop climbing<br/>I choose the mountain<br/>And I shall forever be ascending<br/> <br/>I choose the mountain </i> <br/> <br/><b>Howard Simon</b> <br/> <br/>Again i thank you all a lot, see you soon for the next challenge !</td>', 'Hi and thanks a lot for all your kind comments and the high final note, i''m really flattered ! Thanks also to all the poets here, i''m happy to have inspired you. Til this is not my mother''s tongue, i''m giving you the english poem i found initialy : The low lands callI am tempted to answerThey are offering me a free dwelling Without having to conquer The massive mountain makes its moveBeckoning me to ascendA much more difficult pathTo get up the slippery bend I cannot choose both I have a choice to makeI must be wiseThis will determine my fate I choose, I choose the mountainWith all its stress and strainBecause only by climbingCan I rise above the plain I choose the mountain And I will never stop climbingI choose the mountainAnd I shall forever be ascending I choose the mountain   Howard Simon  Again i thank you all a lot, see you soon for the next challenge !', '2016-09-09 01:27:57.000000', NULL, 0),
